WEBVTT

00:13:26.844 --> 00:13:30.722
A healthier relationship is key.

00:13:31.139 --> 00:13:34.768
A healthier relationship
with Indigenous peoples is key

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.979
to a healthier relationship
with the planet

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.983
that we as Indigenous people protect.

00:13:43.527 --> 00:13:45.696
And then we can all be recycled.

00:13:45.696 --> 00:13:46.864
(Laughter)

00:13:47.531 --> 00:13:51.660
And we can thrive and survive

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.288
on this planet that we call Earth.

00:13:54.705 --> 00:13:55.873
Thank you.

00:13:55.873 --> 00:14:02.713
(Applause and cheers)